title: "bhoonidhi-downloader: A CLI and Python SDK for ISRO's Bhoonidhi EO portal"
abstract: >-
  bhoonidhi-downloader is a command-line tool and Python SDK for searching and
  downloading Earth-observation satellite imagery from ISRO's EO Portal - Bhoonidhi. 
  It provides programmatic authentication, catalogue search by bounding box or point-and-radius, 
  persistent named queries, concurrent verified downloads of open-access scenes, and
  cart staging for priced, on-order, and archived products — an otherwise manual, web-UI-only workflow.
